{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Mahogany Dresser is a piece of furniture. It can rotate into daily stock at the ",["l","木匠的商店","Carpenter's Shop"]," for 7,500g or the ",["l","旅行货车","Traveling Cart"]," for between 250–2,500g."]],["p",["It's also available from the ",["l","家具目录","Furniture Catalogue"]," for 0g."]],["p",["It can be used to store ",["l","衣服","clothing"],", ",["l","帽子","hats"],", ",["l","鞋类","shoes"],", and ",["l","戒指","rings"],"."]],["g",[["Dresser_with_tabs.png",200,["Dresser storage"]]]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.0","1.0"],": Introduced."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.4","1.4"],": Price increased. Added storage functionality."]]]]]]]}